phi-adapter-hue (0.0~git202609081903.a1839f9-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The colour-temperature channel exists whenever a lamp has the
    capability; in colour mode it carries no value. It used to come
    and go with the mode and phi-core recreated it each time.
  * Button windows run on arrival time (phi-adapter-sdk 0.13.1): a
    quadruple click no longer arrives as two doubles.

 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Tue, 08 Sep 2026 19:04:05 +0200

